mic-icon
--------

lightweight mic status indicator for the systray.
like volumeicon but for microphones.

arch linux deps (system packages)
  - python
  - python-pulsectl
  - python-gobject
  - gtk3
  - libappindicator-gtk3
  - pipewire-pulse (or pulseaudio)

install
  python -m venv .venv
  source .venv/bin/activate
  pip install pulsectl pycairo PyGObject

  # symlink into PATH or use make install
  make install

  # run on startup or however you want
  mic-icon &

usage
  mic-icon
  mic-icon --help
  mic-icon --version

license
  0BSD
